# viewport 390x844@3
# Lesson 1 on a phone: the board mirror's buttons picked by touch (generated by tools/gen-plays.mjs).
frames 60
touch =Play
frames 10
touch Learn
frames 10
touch Picking Tiles
until 900 =Pause
frames 10
save l-start
touch Board mirror
frames 10
save l-mirror
touch Tea Leaf tile, available, 1 of 3
frames 20
touch Tea Leaf tile, available, 1 of 2
frames 20
touch Tea Leaf tile, available, 1 of 1
frames 20
until 900 Table cleared
frames 10
expect 310
save l-results
